title: "Agentic AI Rollout Playbook"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-11
url: "https://github.com/vsathiapathi/agentic-ai-rollout-playbook"
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
abstract: >
  A reusable, opinionated blueprint for deploying agentic AI across the
  enterprise on AWS Bedrock + AgentCore and GCP Vertex AI. Covers orchestration
  patterns, RAG architecture, governance frameworks, evaluation harness design,
  90-day rollout planning, and fifteen documented production case studies.
  Battle-tested in regulated environments including financial services,
  healthcare, and logistics.
